      rule: "Simple Past ning inkor va savol shakllari 'did' yordamida yasaladi. DID fe'lining o'tgan zamon ko'rsatkichi:\n\n✅ INKOR: Subject + didn't + V1 (base form)\n  'Didn't' ning o'zi o'tgan zamonda, shuning uchun fe'l asl shaklida qoladi!\n  ❌ She didn't went ❌ (ikki marta o'tgan zamon)\n  ✅ She didn't go ✓\n  ❌ I didn't played ❌\n  ✅ I didn't play ✓\n\n✅ SAVOL: Did + subject + V1 (base form)?\n  Did + I/you/he/she/it/we/they + V1\n  'Did' hamma shaxslar uchun bir xil! (does/did kabi farq yo'q)\n  ❌ Did she went? ❌\n  ✅ Did she go? ✓\n  ❌ Did he played? ❌\n  ✅ Did he play? ✓\n\n✅ WH-SAVOLLAR:\n  What did you do? (Nima qilding?)\n  Where did she go? (U qayerga ketdi?)\n  When did they arrive? (Ular qachon kelishdi?)\n  Why did you say that? (Nega buni aytding?)\n\n🔥 MUHIM: 'Did' o'zi o'tgan zamonni ko'rsatadi, shuning uchun asosiy fe'lga -ed qo'shish shart EMAS!",
