      mnemonic: "🎯 STATIVE = NO -ING in PPC!\n\nESLATMA:\n  Know → had known (✅)\n  Know → had been knowing (❌)\n\n  Like → had liked (✅)\n  Like → had been liking (❌)\n\n  Have (egalik) → had had (✅)\n  Have (egalik) → had been having (❌)\n\nSTATIVENI ESLAB QOLING:\n  K-State: Know, Understand, Believe, Remember, Forget\n  L-State: Like, Love, Hate, Want, Need, Prefer\n  S-State: See, Hear, Smell, Taste, Seem\n  O-State: Own, Belong, Contain, Have (possession)",
